WEBVTT

00:25.420 --> 00:27.180
In a future to come...

00:27.320 --> 00:31.660
the third energy revolution arrives
with the invention of the Shizuma Drive...

00:31.860 --> 00:34.830
and mankind reaches a
newfound period of prosperity.

00:39.400 --> 00:42.200
But within the shadows
of this bright peace...

00:42.300 --> 00:45.070
two powers clash against each other.

00:47.380 --> 00:51.310
A secret organization bent on
world domination, the BF Group!

00:52.750 --> 00:55.840
Everything for Big Fire!

01:16.200 --> 01:19.270
And to oppose this threat,
the Experts of Justice...

01:19.370 --> 01:22.470
is formed from members
gathered from all across the globe!

01:22.580 --> 01:24.410
The International Police Organization!

01:24.710 --> 01:29.580
With them is the most powerful
robot on the planet, Giant Robo...

01:29.720 --> 01:31.980
and the young man who commands it.

01:32.090 --> 01:34.320
His name is Daisaku Kusama!

01:35.860 --> 01:38.020
Crush them! Giant Robo!

01:44.070 --> 01:52.070
<i>GIANT ROBO</i>

01:59.180 --> 02:04.480
<i>THE DAY THE EARTH STOOD STILL</i>

02:34.180 --> 02:36.880
Talk about a surprise...

02:37.890 --> 02:41.910
I thought every nuclear power
source had been dismantled...

02:42.090 --> 02:43.090
Yeah.

02:43.760 --> 02:46.420
Even if it is completely shielded...

02:46.590 --> 02:48.690
To have one so close is...

02:49.460 --> 02:51.190
Yeah.

02:51.800 --> 02:54.600
This is a bit of a problem...

02:57.470 --> 03:01.710
But the truth is right in front of us...

03:02.080 --> 03:06.480
In other words, this has to mean
that the Professor is still alive.

03:06.650 --> 03:07.650
No...

03:08.080 --> 03:09.380
That's not possible.

03:10.320 --> 03:14.720
Then where and how did this
sample survive for ten years?

03:15.090 --> 03:19.890
The only one who could have
made this is Professor Vogler.

03:20.330 --> 03:23.560
Ginrei, you know this better than anyone.

03:27.740 --> 03:28.900
To be honest...

03:29.600 --> 03:33.670
I didn't believe it myself until I
saw what was contained in this case.

03:34.080 --> 03:39.340
But if we employ this sample, all of our
questions will be answered in Shanghai.

03:39.510 --> 03:45.220
Perhaps we can even rectify
the dishonor of ten years ago...

03:54.460 --> 03:55.660
Professor...

03:56.130 --> 03:59.590
I thought we agreed not
to pursue that anymore...

04:00.170 --> 04:01.430
You're right...

04:01.870 --> 04:03.030
That we did.

04:04.110 --> 04:06.130
Everything happened back then...

04:07.910 --> 04:11.470
I am the resurrection, and the
life, he that believeth in me...

04:12.080 --> 04:15.710
though he were dead, yet shall he live.

04:15.850 --> 04:19.290
And whosoever liveth and
believeth in me shall never die.

04:19.620 --> 04:22.180
Those will always have the
light shining down upon them...

04:22.320 --> 04:25.780
and even in the darkness, their
salvation will be promised unto them.

04:25.990 --> 04:28.360
For whether we live,
we live unto the Lord...

04:28.460 --> 04:31.730
and whether we die,
we die unto the Lord.

04:31.900 --> 04:35.770
Whether we live therefore,
or die, we are the Lord's.

04:36.240 --> 04:41.400
We are of the Lord, and let us
pray that the Lord is with us...

04:43.140 --> 04:48.780
I too, like the rest of you gathered with
us today, knew Professor Shizuma well.

04:51.050 --> 04:54.020
And all those who have not met with you...

04:54.290 --> 04:57.780
have had their lives touched by
the energy system created by you.

04:57.930 --> 05:00.790
And, therefore, feel a connection to you.

05:01.030 --> 05:04.630
You are our source of power
and our source of peace.

05:04.970 --> 05:06.990
At other times, you are
our source of strength.

05:07.170 --> 05:08.930
You have become our light...

05:09.040 --> 05:13.770
and have led our way to
prosperity and happiness in the world.

05:15.810 --> 05:19.410
Thanks to you, we have regained
our ability to take to the skies...

05:19.510 --> 05:21.640
by becoming the wings on which we fly.

05:21.820 --> 05:25.650
But for now, the time has come
for you to return to the earth...

05:25.820 --> 05:28.520
To return to the sea that gave us life...

05:28.890 --> 05:31.059
There, you shall find eternal rest.

05:31.060 --> 05:32.250
<i>Professor...</i>

05:32.730 --> 05:36.490
Even though I was with Robo,
we weren't able to save you.

05:36.960 --> 05:38.930
But please rest easy.

05:39.300 --> 05:41.790
I will keep my promise to you.

05:42.170 --> 05:43.430
No matter what!

06:05.890 --> 06:09.090
Two days after we acquired
the attache case in Nanking...

06:09.260 --> 06:12.130
the giant sphere that appeared
during the destruction of Paris...

06:12.230 --> 06:15.100
passed through London, spreading
the Shizuma Drive-nullifying...

06:15.200 --> 06:16.640
Bashtarle Phenomenon...

06:16.870 --> 06:18.546
and it has continued
across the Atlantic.

06:18.570 --> 06:21.770
It landed in North
America, affecting New York...

06:22.680 --> 06:26.170
and Washington DC before
crossing the country to San Francisco.

06:26.850 --> 06:29.320
Everywhere the giant
sphere has passed over...

06:29.420 --> 06:32.250
has been paying for its absolute
dependency on the Shizuma Drive.

06:32.420 --> 06:35.790
These cities incur a complete
breakdown of transportation systems...

06:35.890 --> 06:38.590
and a critical shortage
of food and water.

06:38.860 --> 06:42.560
Of course, with all Shizuma
Drives ceasing to function...

06:42.800 --> 06:47.130
it also means the complete
loss of emergency services.

06:47.300 --> 06:49.630
With two-thirds of the Earth
at a complete standstill...

06:49.770 --> 06:53.170
the level of disaster has
surpassed that of Bashtarle.

06:53.980 --> 06:55.940
I can't help but be impressed by it.

06:56.840 --> 07:01.910
Unlike last time, the nullification field
is only affecting the Shizuma Drives.

07:02.680 --> 07:07.750
The only alternative energy
sources that are left to us are...

07:08.090 --> 07:10.790
inefficient solar
power and fossil fuels.

07:11.760 --> 07:12.760
Damn.

07:13.030 --> 07:19.020
So that's the reason the giant
sphere is crossing the Pacific right now!

07:19.230 --> 07:22.970
I'm sure it's only a matter of
time before Japan becomes still.

07:25.940 --> 07:27.700
You're probably right.

07:28.080 --> 07:32.070
And if it continues on its
course, its objective can only be...

07:32.250 --> 07:35.610
The last oil fields on this
Earth, the Shanghai Oil Fields!

07:36.850 --> 07:41.810
I see, they plan to take away
all our sources of energy...

07:42.160 --> 07:43.520
But, Big Brother!

07:43.790 --> 07:46.780
We'll have the upper
hand in this next operation!

07:46.960 --> 07:48.076
Isn't that right, Professor?

07:48.100 --> 07:49.530
Um, uh...

07:55.500 --> 07:56.990
Man, talk about an antique!

07:57.370 --> 07:58.130
Yes...

07:58.240 --> 08:00.160
This Electromagnetic Net
Wire Generator is not...

08:00.210 --> 08:02.540
powered by the Shizuma Drive...

08:02.640 --> 08:06.010
and it can be used with full
effectiveness against that Giant Sphere!

08:06.710 --> 08:08.240
Leave it to the Chitasei!

08:08.780 --> 08:12.310
But we're up against the BF Group.
We'll only have one chance at this.

08:12.690 --> 08:15.820
What are you saying, Professor Go?

08:16.020 --> 08:19.190
You're the one who came
up with this plan, after all!

08:19.360 --> 08:21.190
I agree! It'll be fine!

08:22.060 --> 08:25.590
And even if this operation doesn't
work out, we'll still have Robo.

08:27.700 --> 08:29.190
Professor Shizuma said so!

08:29.840 --> 08:32.770
He said that Giant Robo is
the only one that can defeat it!

08:33.110 --> 08:36.010
So, if we let Robo
take it on, it'll be all right!

08:36.210 --> 08:38.270
H-Hey, Daisaku...

08:38.450 --> 08:40.656
What do you mean that
you're going to let Robo fight it?

08:40.680 --> 08:41.679
You do realize...

08:41.680 --> 08:42.680
<i>Experts!</i>

08:43.320 --> 08:46.880
General Kanshin has given us
approval to proceed with this operation.

08:47.460 --> 08:52.790
So, all able Experts are
to gather in Shanghai.

08:53.090 --> 08:53.690
Yes sir!

08:53.960 --> 08:55.360
All right!

08:56.400 --> 08:59.130
And so, from the Peking Branch...

08:59.530 --> 09:00.590
Ginrei.

09:01.600 --> 09:03.370
Issei Koshinsho the Warrior Monk.

09:03.940 --> 09:05.630
Youshi the Blue Beast.

09:06.140 --> 09:08.630
And Taiso the Fleet Footed!

09:09.240 --> 09:11.340
You four will be sent on this mission!

09:13.680 --> 09:17.680
Now, Professor Go and myself
will be part of a second group...

09:18.090 --> 09:22.150
that will head for Ryozanpaku
and make plans for future operations.

09:22.560 --> 09:23.680
Um...

09:25.560 --> 09:26.990
Oh, and as for Daisaku...

09:27.160 --> 09:28.160
Yes sir!

09:30.000 --> 09:33.730
You and Tetsugyu will remain onboard
and rendezvous with us at Ryozanpaku.

09:33.830 --> 09:35.030
And there...

09:40.680 --> 09:42.870
There, Robo will be sealed away...

09:50.650 --> 09:51.650
Robo?

09:52.020 --> 09:53.250
I repeat!

09:53.690 --> 09:57.180
You will be given the responsibility
of taking Robo to Ryozanpaku...

09:57.290 --> 09:59.190
and there, you are to seal it away!

09:59.290 --> 10:01.130
B-But why is that?

10:01.500 --> 10:03.230
It's unnecessary for me to explain myself.

10:03.430 --> 10:05.760
Taiso, what are you still doing here?

10:06.100 --> 10:08.016
Don't you need to go make
preparations for your mission?

10:08.040 --> 10:09.130
Y-Yes sir...

10:09.470 --> 10:10.470
Commander!

10:10.810 --> 10:12.470
The rest of you as well!

10:12.740 --> 10:13.760
Sir!

10:13.870 --> 10:14.970
But Commander!

10:16.310 --> 10:17.310
Why?

10:17.510 --> 10:19.570
Why are you sealing Robo away?

10:19.950 --> 10:21.580
Please answer me! Commander!

10:21.850 --> 10:23.880
Please let me go to Shanghai!

10:24.550 --> 10:26.350
Let me go with Robo!

10:30.930 --> 10:34.490
And even still, the Seine flows...

10:35.930 --> 10:40.530
Even with that newcomer at the
helm, this operation is really something.

10:40.800 --> 10:43.430
Driving the masses to panic
with the memories of Bashtarle...

10:43.540 --> 10:46.530
and using the Samples to
control the Shizuma Drives...

10:46.670 --> 10:49.970
After we immobilize our enemies, we
hold the Shanghai Oil Fields as ransom...

10:50.080 --> 10:52.050
until the whole world surrenders to us.

10:52.250 --> 10:53.680
It's quite brilliant.

10:56.450 --> 10:58.890
But of course, it's
also troublesome that...

10:59.020 --> 11:01.960
even members of the BF Group
like the two of us are affected...

11:02.690 --> 11:05.960
Ivan, don't you find it a bit strange?

11:06.160 --> 11:07.160
Huh?

11:07.260 --> 11:12.290
Why is our master, Big Fire,
setting all these events into motion?

11:12.470 --> 11:15.440
For world domination, of course...

11:17.140 --> 11:21.080
But Giant Robo, which
was built in secrecy...

11:21.340 --> 11:23.900
revives our fears of nuclear power...

11:24.310 --> 11:27.870
and the Giant Sphere
nullifies all Shizuma Drives...

11:28.220 --> 11:32.980
don't these things pose a
danger to the BF Group as well?

11:33.520 --> 11:34.610
Lord Alberto!

11:34.720 --> 11:37.390
You're a member of the Magnificent Ten!

11:38.630 --> 11:40.990
And your words can be
deemed traitorous to our master...

11:41.100 --> 11:42.100
Ivan!

11:48.470 --> 11:49.660
F-Forgive me!

11:49.840 --> 11:52.000
I forgot my place, and spoke out of turn...

11:52.640 --> 11:54.070
I was merely dealing with a rat...

11:54.640 --> 11:56.240
Never mind. Let's go!

12:18.100 --> 12:21.130
Prepare helicopters for launch!

12:21.240 --> 12:23.300
Begin launch procedures, Level B!

12:23.400 --> 12:24.900
Mount Option B armaments!

12:25.310 --> 12:27.500
That's right! Load the
minimum ammunition only!

12:27.640 --> 12:30.410
All we have to do is get to Shanghai!

12:31.080 --> 12:32.980
Speed is of the essence!

12:33.110 --> 12:35.480
Besides, these choppers
use the Shizuma Drive...

12:35.620 --> 12:37.410
so all they have to do is get us there!

12:48.830 --> 12:50.960
Are we ready to go?

12:51.070 --> 12:52.620
Yeah! We're all set!

12:52.730 --> 12:55.970
But the Anti-Shizuma
field is spreading fast...

12:56.700 --> 12:59.170
That just means we have to go faster!

13:07.350 --> 13:08.820
Daisaku...

13:17.190 --> 13:18.190
Why?

13:18.230 --> 13:19.590
What's the reason?

13:19.690 --> 13:22.990
Why are you sealing Robo away?

13:23.130 --> 13:26.660
That's right, at least let me
go to Shanghai, Commander!

13:27.030 --> 13:30.160
I'm sure we can use all
the people we can get there!

13:30.270 --> 13:33.110
Why does the Black
Wind have to stay behind?

13:33.210 --> 13:34.570
It just doesn't make sense!

13:34.680 --> 13:36.080
That's enough, Tetsugyu!

13:36.680 --> 13:38.340
Then, please give us an answer!

13:38.450 --> 13:39.450
Commander!

13:40.180 --> 13:41.980
Why aren't you letting Robo go?

13:42.180 --> 13:45.350
Up until now, it's always been
safer to have Robo around!

13:45.490 --> 13:49.050
Or is this your way of saying you're
afraid of Robo's nuclear power source?

13:54.830 --> 13:56.130
That must be it...

13:56.860 --> 13:59.460
If we let Robo fight when the
Shizuma Drives aren't functioning...

13:59.570 --> 14:03.370
that would reveal
Robo's secret to the world...

14:03.900 --> 14:05.200
And...

14:06.210 --> 14:08.270
if something should happen to Robo...

14:08.440 --> 14:09.440
Hey!

14:09.510 --> 14:11.500
What the heck are you saying?

14:11.680 --> 14:15.640
Listen, the Commander said that
fighting the Giant Sphere head-on...

14:15.750 --> 14:18.340
is too dangerous!

14:19.420 --> 14:22.360
But Robo is the most
powerful robot in the world!

14:22.590 --> 14:23.590
Daisaku!

14:24.290 --> 14:28.160
Please listen to what I have to say!
In exchange, I have a favor to ask.

14:28.300 --> 14:32.230
Should something happen
to all of us in Shanghai...

14:32.470 --> 14:33.470
then...

14:33.800 --> 14:37.470
and only then... will the
job fall to you and Robo.

14:38.940 --> 14:40.870
But I want to defeat that thing!

14:42.440 --> 14:44.440
That duty was handed
down to me by my father!

14:44.550 --> 14:45.950
He's right!

14:46.050 --> 14:49.450
Let's put Robo up
against that Giant Sphere!

14:49.550 --> 14:50.250
Hey!

14:50.550 --> 14:52.080
This is the order from HQ.

14:52.650 --> 14:56.320
If you cannot follow orders, then
you have no right to be an Expert.

14:56.520 --> 14:57.520
Understand?

14:59.830 --> 15:04.230
To think that I get babysitting
duty just before a big battle!

15:04.870 --> 15:05.890
Give me a break!

15:06.000 --> 15:07.130
Hey, hey!

15:07.230 --> 15:08.790
What the hell are you doing?

15:10.340 --> 15:14.300
B-But, Big Brother, at least
you get to go to Shanghai!

15:19.980 --> 15:22.210
I still can't accept it...

15:23.250 --> 15:24.250
Why...

15:24.450 --> 15:27.180
Why doesn't Robo have a
Shizuma Drive for a power source?

15:28.060 --> 15:31.290
Why does Robo have to be nuclear-powered?

15:32.590 --> 15:33.790
Father...

15:34.700 --> 15:37.360
Are you just going to
remain silent, Father?

15:41.100 --> 15:42.100
Father...

15:44.440 --> 15:46.670
What Taiso said was true.

15:46.810 --> 15:47.870
Ginrei...

15:50.040 --> 15:53.950
You and Robo are the most
important part of our strength.

15:54.080 --> 15:55.980
So don't be so down, okay?

15:56.880 --> 15:59.650
But I can't help but feel
like I'm all alone again.

16:00.120 --> 16:01.550
What are you saying?

16:01.720 --> 16:04.820
You're a fine member
of the Experts of Justice.

16:05.030 --> 16:10.430
But Tetsugyu says that
without Robo, I'm only a kid.

16:12.900 --> 16:14.430
He's just jealous of you...

16:16.140 --> 16:20.440
Jealous that even though you're
only twelve, you can control Robo...

16:21.080 --> 16:25.070
But at twelve, it's so hard...

16:25.310 --> 16:27.580
When I was twelve, I was...

16:27.780 --> 16:29.510
Father!

16:29.780 --> 16:31.480
Father!

16:30.680 --> 16:31.480
<i>No!</i>

16:31.590 --> 16:33.080
It's too late now!

16:33.790 --> 16:35.560
But we can't just let him...

16:35.561 --> 16:37.460
<i>The Professor has made his choice!</i>

16:37.560 --> 16:39.690
It's impossible! You have to let it go!

16:40.090 --> 16:42.290
BUT we can't...

16:42.900 --> 16:44.730
It's too horrible!

16:52.540 --> 16:53.540
Ginrei!

16:54.240 --> 16:55.240
Hurry!

16:55.380 --> 16:56.870
It's time! What are you doing?

16:59.150 --> 17:01.120
What's the matter? We're ready to go!

17:01.220 --> 17:02.340
Uh, okay!

17:04.620 --> 17:06.380
Well, I'll be off.

17:06.750 --> 17:08.120
Um...

17:15.000 --> 17:16.360
Don't worry.

17:16.700 --> 17:20.130
Professor Go's plan will succeed.

17:20.670 --> 17:26.130
And also, what do you
think about your father?

17:32.480 --> 17:33.880
For me, he is...

18:17.830 --> 18:18.830
Hey!

18:20.730 --> 18:22.960
Where's your usual spunk?

18:24.060 --> 18:25.230
I'm all right!

18:26.300 --> 18:28.600
All right, then come with me.

18:28.700 --> 18:31.230
I'll take you out for some fun.

19:32.200 --> 19:33.220
This is bad...

19:33.330 --> 19:35.500
That thing is starting to move faster...

19:55.190 --> 19:57.060
We've finally reached Shanghai...

19:57.220 --> 20:00.320
If I had all three samples,
as I did ten years ago...

20:00.430 --> 20:03.420
I wouldn't need to go
through all this trouble.

20:03.530 --> 20:04.760
But it's all right.

20:04.900 --> 20:10.600
Soon, all of you will learn who
brought forth the beautiful night!

20:25.990 --> 20:28.460
Shanghai is being enveloped
by the Anti-Shizuma Field!

20:28.660 --> 20:30.720
All right, switch to conventional fuel!

20:36.200 --> 20:38.460
Quickly, set up the Wire Machines!

20:38.600 --> 20:41.800
The fate of the world
rests upon this battle!

20:45.040 --> 20:49.340
The timing of the Wire activation
from the twenty-six units...

20:49.480 --> 20:51.910
will be controlled at this location.

20:52.480 --> 20:55.680
Set the communications
frequency to code 1-3-0-0.

21:01.560 --> 21:03.680
Units A to F, settings complete!

21:04.890 --> 21:06.090
What's our time limit?

21:06.230 --> 21:07.420
Ten minutes!

21:08.360 --> 21:10.460
Have all fuel pipelines been connected?

21:17.870 --> 21:20.770
Units G through M and Q
through Z are ready to go!

21:21.170 --> 21:23.540
Only ones remaining are Units N, O and P!

21:29.880 --> 21:31.410
Good, we'll be ready in time!

21:31.520 --> 21:34.420
Confirm location of all units
and calculate projected trajectory!

21:34.590 --> 21:35.590
Roger!

21:39.430 --> 21:41.990
The Giant Sphere is moving
along course projection D!

21:42.100 --> 21:44.700
Three-three-five-three until it
reaches mission activation point!

21:45.130 --> 21:46.430
Okay, lock it in!

21:47.270 --> 21:49.400
I have to hand it to Professor Go.

21:49.840 --> 21:53.360
To think up such a brilliant
way to deal with that Sphere.

21:54.940 --> 21:56.030
That's right.

21:56.280 --> 22:00.680
If we can get it into the middle of
the Wire Net, we can surround it...

22:00.910 --> 22:04.480
and use the electromagnetic
reaction to propel it into space!

22:08.720 --> 22:10.780
It reminds me of what
happened ten years ago...

22:11.160 --> 22:15.790
This same unit was used to control
the phenomenon at Bashtarle...

22:16.300 --> 22:19.100
I hope it works for us again...

22:21.940 --> 22:23.100
Listen, Ginrei.

22:23.970 --> 22:28.570
You must open this case when you
enter the Sphere's Anti-Shizuma Field.

22:29.080 --> 22:31.810
Then all will be made clear.

22:34.680 --> 22:36.050
Father...

22:36.350 --> 22:37.980
Vogler has landed!

22:55.070 --> 22:56.760
The target is entering the mission area!

22:58.970 --> 23:02.050
All right, let it get as close as possible
to the center of the mission area!

23:02.210 --> 23:05.840
But be ready to activate the wires in
case something unexpected happens!

23:05.950 --> 23:06.570
Understood?

23:06.680 --> 23:07.200
Roger!

23:07.480 --> 23:08.510
Standing by!

23:08.680 --> 23:10.910
This is Unit J, the Sphere
is passing our location!

23:40.980 --> 23:42.110
Not yet...

23:42.320 --> 23:43.650
A bit more...

23:43.920 --> 23:45.550
Draw it in further...

23:52.690 --> 23:54.180
Not yet...

23:57.800 --> 23:59.230
A bit further...

23:59.970 --> 24:01.990
A bit further...

24:12.650 --> 24:13.650
Activate!

24:29.830 --> 24:30.830
Is it working?

24:44.040 --> 24:45.040
Okay!

24:45.150 --> 24:47.810
Maximum power! We'll
launch that thing into space!

25:03.730 --> 25:05.460
Electromagnetic wires!

25:06.100 --> 25:09.800
Everything was the same ten
years ago! That's fine, then...

25:16.940 --> 25:18.500
That's... So it's true...

25:22.380 --> 25:25.550
The Electromagnetic Net Wire
Operation has commenced in Shanghai!

25:25.720 --> 25:28.190
At present we have succeeded
in snaring the Giant Sphere...

25:28.290 --> 25:31.520
and we're proceeding
to phase two of the mission.

25:31.860 --> 25:34.520
Professor Go, please
report to Mission Control!

25:41.800 --> 25:42.860
Good. Ginrei...

25:43.740 --> 25:46.470
We're receiving the data properly.

25:47.340 --> 25:51.210
With this simulation, everything
should be made clear, including...

25:51.380 --> 25:53.280
how to protect the Shizuma Drives...

25:53.550 --> 25:54.550
Professor Go!

25:57.880 --> 25:58.580
Commander?

25:58.690 --> 26:01.350
Professor Go, we have a situation.

26:02.660 --> 26:03.660
Huh?

26:03.790 --> 26:07.350
The Greta Garbo has disappeared
over the skies of Wuhan.

26:07.530 --> 26:08.590
What did you say?

26:09.060 --> 26:11.460
This is a dire situation.

26:29.720 --> 26:30.450
What's wrong?

26:30.550 --> 26:31.750
We're losing power output!

26:38.660 --> 26:41.220
That can't be! We checked everything!

26:41.460 --> 26:42.900
Everything is working fine here.

26:46.100 --> 26:47.100
Why, you...

26:48.400 --> 26:52.770
That's right, Experts
of Justice. I am Ivan!

26:53.110 --> 26:55.200
How dare you interfere in our operation!

27:03.080 --> 27:04.080
Listen up!

27:04.220 --> 27:08.280
No matter what little tricks
you try, you are no match for us!

27:09.090 --> 27:11.320
You just sit back and watch!

27:13.060 --> 27:14.690
Come, Uranus!

27:29.340 --> 27:30.570
Damn!

27:42.220 --> 27:44.050
Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm in a hurry.

27:44.160 --> 27:49.360
Even the Uranus will become a useless
lump of metal before the Vogler Sphere.

27:52.800 --> 27:53.630
It's coming!

27:53.770 --> 27:55.760
Have we been discovered?

28:23.300 --> 28:26.600
The operation has failed, hasn't it?

28:26.700 --> 28:27.700
Curse it all...

28:28.100 --> 28:29.970
There's no time to stand around!

28:31.040 --> 28:32.040
Stay on guard!

28:43.050 --> 28:45.280
Today the BF Group will be victorious!

28:45.790 --> 28:47.980
There is nothing more you can do!

28:52.160 --> 28:54.090
What's the matter, Uranus?

28:58.600 --> 28:59.600
What?

29:00.800 --> 29:02.030
This sound!

29:02.740 --> 29:03.740
It can't be!

29:14.910 --> 29:15.940
What's this?

29:33.300 --> 29:34.600
That's Tetsugyu!

29:36.840 --> 29:38.670
Then this is...

30:23.220 --> 30:25.550
So you're here, Giant Robo!

30:25.790 --> 30:26.980
And...

30:29.790 --> 30:31.520
Daisaku Kusama as well!

30:32.630 --> 30:33.630
Daisaku...

30:33.960 --> 30:36.230
Then, Tetsugyu...

30:37.330 --> 30:40.270
Okay! Let's see this strength of yours!

30:54.780 --> 30:56.980
Now, Giant Robo!

31:02.960 --> 31:04.290
Let's go!

31:30.650 --> 31:32.450
Punch it, Giant Robo!

31:32.890 --> 31:35.050
Crush them, Uranus!

31:45.330 --> 31:51.500
Even though it's the enemy now, I'm
amazed by that former BF Group robot.

32:00.710 --> 32:02.440
What? A barrier?

32:02.680 --> 32:04.310
Then I'll attack it from underground!

32:10.290 --> 32:11.350
What's the matter?

32:16.430 --> 32:19.190
Oh no, I got too close to the Sphere!

32:23.270 --> 32:24.790
Now, Robo!

32:33.480 --> 32:35.570
This is Ivan! I'm done for!

32:36.080 --> 32:37.910
Everything for Big Fire!

32:38.420 --> 32:39.610
I leave the rest to you, sir!

32:41.150 --> 32:42.710
Everything for Big Fire!

32:47.090 --> 32:48.190
He did it!

32:48.290 --> 32:49.290
But...

32:49.400 --> 32:50.760
His real target is...

32:51.330 --> 32:52.160
There it is!

32:52.270 --> 32:54.430
The Giant Sphere, Vogler!

33:18.290 --> 33:20.690
As I feared, it's...

33:20.990 --> 33:21.990
my father!

33:22.460 --> 33:23.760
Professor Vogler!

33:26.930 --> 33:28.530
I won't forgive you, BF Group!

33:29.070 --> 33:32.270
I won't let you ruin the Shizuma Drive!

33:33.110 --> 33:37.740
I'll avenge the tragedy of ten years
ago and the death of Professor Shizuma!

33:39.250 --> 33:40.980
N-No, don't!

33:41.180 --> 33:42.740
Daisaku, don't fight it!

33:42.880 --> 33:45.040
No, stop! Daisaku!

33:45.820 --> 33:46.840
I'll show you!

33:46.990 --> 33:47.990
Robo!

33:55.360 --> 33:57.850
Please stop! Father!

34:00.400 --> 34:02.630
Go!

34:28.390 --> 34:29.390
This is not happening...

34:37.870 --> 34:38.870
Robo!

34:45.750 --> 34:48.110
Robo!

34:50.980 --> 34:52.580
Daisaku!

34:57.690 --> 35:05.690
<i>Episode 3: The Electromagnetic
Net Operation: The Fall at Shanghai</i>

37:52.800 --> 37:54.490
In the ruins of Shanghai...

37:54.670 --> 37:57.300
the cries of anguish become a
roar and echo across the world!

37:57.400 --> 38:00.460
Ginrei trembles and
Tetsugyu lowers his head.

38:00.740 --> 38:04.540
Issei and Youshi throw themselves
into the flames of the battle...

38:04.780 --> 38:07.610
only to have all hope torn
away by Alberto's shockwaves.

38:07.710 --> 38:09.980
Then, amidst the flames of destruction...

38:10.080 --> 38:13.750
Taiso goes to face
Vogler's Sphere on his own.

38:13.850 --> 38:16.820
Listen, Daisaku, you're not alone.

38:16.920 --> 38:20.090
You and Robo together have
to fight alongside the others!

38:20.230 --> 38:24.160
Isn't Robo the most
important friend you have?

38:24.300 --> 38:26.930
Yes, I understand, Taiso!

38:28.370 --> 38:33.930
Next episode, "Twilight of the Heroes!
The Bells of Victory Have Yet to Toll!"

38:34.110 --> 38:36.800
Will Giant Robo rise again?
